id: saiyan-soul
name: Saiyan Soul
talentCategory: racial
race: saiyan
prerequisites: Saiyan
description: >
  As the battle wages ever onward, you adapt to the ever-changing tides of war.
text: >
  Saiyan Soul: As the battle wages ever onward, you adapt to the ever-changing tides of war.
  –Prerequisites: Saiyan
  (1)-[Passive]: Increase your Racial Life Modifier by 2.
  (2)-[Passive]: While you have your maximum number of Battle Born stacks, increase your Wound Rolls by 1(T).
  (3)-[2/Round]: As an Instant Maneuver, move up to 2 of your Battle Born stacks applied to a Combat Roll to another Combat Roll of your choice.

---

[passive]
# (1)
racialLifeModifier += 2;
# (2) Every Combat Roll at its 2 (or past it, Born for Battle (3)'s).
if (stacksAtLeast(2, "battlebornstrike") && stacksAtLeast(2, "battleborndodge") && stacksAtLeast(2, "battlebornwound")) {
    wound += 1(T);
}
# (3) Its own Maneuver, on the Maneuvers tab (maneuvers/saiyan-soul-third-effect.dbu).
